# Build output
*.o
*.d
z88dk-80cc
ir_selftest

# Everything below is anchored to src/80cc itself (leading /), so the tracked
# subdirectories — scripts/, adr/, probes-retired/, regression/ — are unaffected.
#
# This directory accumulates working files: analysis scripts, probe patches,
# assembler dumps and one-off benches. They are tools, not project sources, and
# they must not be swept into a commit by a careless `git add -A`.
/*.py
/*.sh
/*.patch.txt
/*.asm
/*.txt
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Scratch C files that have been committed by accident before
/nullbench.c
/t1.c
